# CODEOWNERS — required reviewers per path.
#
# This only takes effect when branch protection on `main` has
# "Require review from Code Owners" enabled (see docs/BRANCH-PROTECTION.md).
#
# PREREQUISITE: the @gatesfoundation/* teams below must exist, which requires
# this repo to live in the gatesfoundation GitHub org (personal repos can't
# use org teams). Replace the org/team handles with the real ones.
#
# NOTE: CODEOWNERS controls WHO must approve, not HOW MANY. The approval
# *count* (2 for foundation-wide, 1 for group) is set in branch protection and
# is a single value per branch — see docs/BRANCH-PROTECTION.md for how we
# reconcile the two-tier requirement.

# --- Catalog-level / process files → Skills Working Group ---
/.github/                @gatesfoundation/skills-working-group
/.claude-plugin/         @gatesfoundation/skills-working-group
/scripts/                @gatesfoundation/skills-working-group
/CONTRIBUTING.md         @gatesfoundation/skills-working-group
/README.md               @gatesfoundation/skills-working-group

# --- Foundation-wide skills → Skills Working Group (policy: 2 approvals) ---
/foundation-wide/        @gatesfoundation/skills-working-group

# --- Group skills → the owning group's leads (policy: 1 approval) ---
/groups/idm/                 @gatesfoundation/idm-leads
/groups/global-health/       @gatesfoundation/global-health-leads
/groups/global-development/  @gatesfoundation/global-development-leads
/groups/policy/              @gatesfoundation/policy-leads
/groups/finance/             @gatesfoundation/finance-leads
/groups/it/                  @gatesfoundation/it-leads
